## Default Analytics distributions to logarithmic scale

Context: Knowledge Graph Analytics distributions are typically heavy-tailed,
but every visit started on a linear count axis. The Log scale option is now
selected on initial load and remains user-toggleable for linear inspection.

Changes:

1. src/front/templates/partials/dtwin/_query_analytics.html
   Render the Log scale switch as selected by default.
2. src/front/static/query/js/query-analytics.js
   Initialize the chart state consistently with the selected switch.
3. tests/units/front/test_analytics_dashboard.py
   Replace the legacy linear-default contract with the logarithmic default.
4. docs/user-guide.md
   Document the default scale and how to return to raw linear counts.

