## Add exhaustive metric-series SQL contract

Context: Task 1 of the KG Analytics all-node series requires a validated SQL
query helper that returns an exhaustive metric series payload. This adds the
allowlisted metric contract, deterministic ordering, and pagination controls
for downstream tasks to consume.

Changes:

1. tests/units/core/test_job_metrics.py
   Add TDD contracts for metric-series SQL text, full allowlist acceptance, and invalid metric rejection with ValidationError.
2. src/back/core/graph_analysis/JobMetrics.py
   Add METRIC_SERIES_COLUMNS and metric_series_query() with strict metric validation plus normalized limit/offset bounds.
3. src/back/core/graph_analysis/__init__.py
   Export metric_series_query and METRIC_SERIES_COLUMNS from the graph_analysis package surface.
4. .superpowers/sdd/task-1-report.md
   Record task status, RED/GREEN evidence, commit metadata, and self-review notes for Task 1.

